                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.1211/65: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Summerlin</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-04-22T10:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 22,
                                1923—10 a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>32. Inform Mr. Pani that date specified in your 25 April 21, 10 p.m. for
                    publication of identic statement is satisfactory to Department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
